 row for sources.\r\n\r\n### Commit protocols in Quicksilver\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- coverage: L08c-05 --\u003e\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n### Log maintenance and the shadow graph\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- coverage: L08c-06 --\u003e\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n### Implementation notes and performance\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- coverage: L08c-07 --\u003e\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n### System R recovery: write-ahead log and shadow pages\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- coverage: L08c-08 --\u003e\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n### OS-level transactions (TxOS)\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- coverage: L08c-09 --\u003e\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n### Large-scale incremental processing (Percolator) transactions\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- coverage: L08c-10 --\u003e\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n## Mechanisms step by step\r\n\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n## Worked examples\r\n\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n## Comparison\r\n\r\n\u003e [!todo] Seed\r\n\u003e To be written; see the coverage matrix row for sources.\r\n\r\n## Paper deep dives\r\n\r\n- [Lightweight Recoverable Virtual Memory](../Papers/L08-LRVM.md)\r\n- [Free Transactions with Rio Vista](../Papers/L08-Rio-Vista.md)\r\n- [Recovery Management in QuickSilver](../Papers/L08-Quicksilver.md)\r\n- [The Recovery Manager of the System R Database Manager](../Papers/L08-System-R-Recovery-Manager.md)\r\n- [Operating System Transactions](../Papers/L08-OS-Transactions.md)\r\n- [Large-scale Incremental Processing Using Distributed Transactions and Notifications](../